    session.transfer(flowFile, REL_FAILURE)
} {code}
 

The documentation in for [ExecuteScript|https://nifi.apache.org/components/org.apache.nifi.processors.script.ExecuteScript/] has more information how to use specific constructs in scripts. A most important line there is:
{quote}Executes a script given the flow file and a process session. The script is responsible for handling the incoming flow file (transfer to SUCCESS or remove, e.g.) as well as any flow files created by the script. If the handling is incomplete or incorrect, the session will be rolled back.
{quote}

